  "answer": "**答案：1946 年。**\n\n推理链：\n- Kanye West 的《Power》用了 King Crimson 的《21st Century Schizoid Man》里的人声采样。\n- King Crimson 的领队是 Robert Fripp。他是乐队的创建者，也是唯一一直在队里的成员。他 1946 年 5 月 16 日生于英格兰多塞特郡的 Wimborne Minster。\n\n只搜了 1 次。\n\nSources:\n- [Variety：Kanye West's King Crimson Sample in 'Power' Sparks Lawsuit](https://au.variety.com/2022/music/news/universal-music-kanye-west-king-crimson-lawsuit-2159)\n- [Mixmag：Universal Music hit with lawsuit for Kanye West's 'Power'](https://mixmag.net/read/universal-music-lawsuit-for-kanye-west-power-news)\n- [Wikipedia：Robert Fripp](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Robert_Fripp)",
